					"content": "多謝您提供的素材，這些報酬還請收下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪達赫"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001707,
					"content": "以後還有什麼故事，記得分享給我啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
